OL,3,GNEWSAPolice confirm woman injured on
OL,4,AGlasgow street was shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman found injured on a Glasgow
OL,7,Fstreet was shot, police have confirmed.
OL,9,FThe 27-year-old was taken to hospital
OL,10,Fafter emergency services were called to
OL,11,FEynort Street in the city's Lambhill
OL,12,Farea at about 23:45 on Monday. Her
OL,13,Fcondition is unknown.
OL,15,FThe force previously stated inquiries
OL,16,Fwere ongoing into the incident, but
OL,17,Fhave now confirmed it was a shooting.
OL,19,FThe street remained closed off on
OL,20,FTuesday as police, including forensics
OL,21,Fofficers, combed the scene.
